{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"12963","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:12963","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"くまちゃん(青羽伴幸、まりんれいく)","creatorId":"vndb:s2949","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:14345","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2949","name":"くまちゃん(青羽伴幸、まりんれいく)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:90321","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"都築真紀","creatorId":"vndb:s5509","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:300","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5509","name":"都築真紀","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:79994","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"長岡建蔵(美駒)","creatorId":"egs:creator:58","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:58","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:58","name":"長岡建蔵(美駒)","detail":"配信コンテンツ用UIデザイン","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:175503","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"都築真紀","creatorId":"vndb:s5509","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:300","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5509","name":"都築真紀","detail":"原作","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:79995","source":"egs"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_16683","characterName":"やがみ はやて","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16683","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"16683","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"やがみ はやて","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"関西出身で、柔らかな関西弁を話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から患っている脚の麻痺のために通院治療中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物心つく前に両親を亡くし、一人で暮らす不幸な身の上だが、 歪むこともなく、優しくまっすぐに育った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちょっとおっとりしているが明るく優しく、世話好きな性格で、趣味は読書と料理。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"料理はとても上手で、車椅子でも調理ができるようキッチンを工夫して、日々料理にいそしんでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16683"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学校","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16683","value":"私立聖祥大附属小学校"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/3627648eab71108a7af44e988e0b806e98c0df762d8534ed6205d3cb0635e7bd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4c9f5a860a3805fcf71dfb1dfed3b7c0bb1921443f44c8ad9563952cb8840e45.webp","width":180,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"植田佳奈","creatorId":"vndb:s17","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17","name":"植田 佳奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:16683:4263:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18423","characterName":"希葛蓝姆","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18423","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"18423","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"希葛蓝姆","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"168"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"闇の書より出でし守護騎士ヴォルケンリッターの将たる『剣の騎士』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"闇の書の意志による二つ名は『烈火の将』。 ヴォルケンリッターの面々は「リーダー」と呼ぶときもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"騎士道精神を貫く武人で、愛剣のアームドデバイス『レヴァンティン（Laevatein）』を手に戦場を駆ける、凛々しいという言葉が似合う美女。外見年齢は19歳(A's設定資料集から)で、ロングストレートの髪を普段はポニーテイルにくくっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：時空管理局本局　古代遺物管理部　機動六課　ライトニング分隊(以前は航空武装隊第1039部隊→ミッドチルダ首都航空隊第14部隊副隊長)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"階級：二等空尉"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"役職：ライトニング分隊副隊長"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"局員ID：XTF01241-015214280"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コールサイン：ライトニング02"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法術式：古代ベルカ式・空戦S-ランク"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所持資格：中隊指揮官/普通自動車免許"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/51e11da6eed84556a951cd057cf3792caf211f3af3976cfda9ecbff5b8c7bd24.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d09b91738b9e272177626a7f62a12f0207a7dd9eedf78f55cd6ae6819f9d6860.webp","width":87,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水香里","creatorId":"vndb:s5724","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5724","name":"清水 香里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:18423:3838:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18424","characterName":"札斐拉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18424","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"18424","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"札斐拉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"203"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守護騎士ヴォルケンリッターの一員で、『盾の守護獣』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"闇の書の意志による二つ名は『蒼き狼』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アルフと同系の獣人の男性で、獣モードと人間モードの２形態を使い分けている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18424"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2ef858857b56a554ff05e8032eae2a53463498f5a45cb7cb0f85d66a0be4763.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09ce690aa272a1b8030240cb06275e8d78e1d00f9834f7e91d3a35ae40fe2bea.webp","width":179,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一条和矢","creatorId":"vndb:s256","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s256","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s256","name":"一条 和矢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:18424:4612:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18425","characterName":"Reinforce Eins","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18425","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"18425","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Reinforce Eins","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"闇の書に内包されているヴォルケンリッター同様のプログラム。主と融合して魔力の統制、及び発動を行う。 言うなればヴォルケンリッター最後の騎士といったところ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「夜天の主の名において汝に新たな名を贈る。強く支えるもの、幸運の追い風、祝福のエール、リインフォース」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18425"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/66f2de41b9ddd4f4dfee5f347bfe5e3b3a78296084950f5e941e5707c2825d97.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74a7c9f90bbbad424dad9d01c254aeb83782749406b7b387daf464912e920bbf.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林沙苗","creatorId":"vndb:s479","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s479","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s479","name":"小林沙苗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:18425:4428:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18427","characterName":"Administrative Bureau","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18427","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"18427","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Administrative Bureau","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Administrative bureau"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"綴りは公式ページから。直訳すると「管理する部局」であり、「時空」の意味はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"次元世界における司法機関。ミッドチルダ他、幾つかの世界が共同で運営している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"次元世界から質量兵器の根絶とロストロギアの規制を働きかけてきた組織。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"各次元世界の管理を始めたのは約150年前。75年前に成立し、管理局システムを作りあげ、これを期に新暦に変わった模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地上本部がミッドチルダにあるのは「ミッドが管理局発祥の地」である為。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18427"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3b031070cfd134bf17ab3bce687ae3acf8c74cef85ced2069c682858ffe0bfe1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e491396e9eb8d947dd693bf6ae0bf62e985953c9d58d4f970b0dd6d96cc08088.webp","width":256,"height":233,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_19853","characterName":"Arf","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"19853","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"19853","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Arf","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"菲特的使魔，真实形态为红色皮毛的母狼。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"19853"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de2780e8a5a34942aa5ef9151d498c9cc8f63584fd0c4613c2c4eda76c3d8205.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbc29df99822f501a5e7378b4082f808abecb08911f07608569d790fa1f7bfea.webp","width":220,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桑谷夏子","creatorId":"vndb:s1143","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1143","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1143","name":"桑谷 夏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:19853:4168:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20048","characterName":"Leti Lowran","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20048","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Leti Lowran","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"时空管理局本局运用部提督，琳蒂提督的友人，似乎酒品不佳。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20048"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4dc42797315409361562bcb0ad1174c3b93bac7f9996ff4cbdbef9eed6e48a3b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cfdd8e21e8b5b73ec31f8f28bf509284f6bfad25efa5ee3514e66f955dade1f8.webp","width":108,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20089","characterName":"月村铃香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20089","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"月村铃香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"月村忍的妹妹，奈叶、菲特、爱丽莎等人的朋友和同学，温柔善良的富家之女。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20089"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bcf21ba59f15e5c011fceb25cb796702421ce97095b2f3011c20d42a6bbd2587.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/588b6afc4e666c1f4cff1bbddcd1b8484345137ec50f907bcb926807619da1cb.webp","width":113,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水愛","creatorId":"vndb:s416","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s416","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s416","name":"清水 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:20089:4064:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20206","characterName":"莱维·萨·史拉夏","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20206","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"20206","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"莱维·萨·史拉夏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏设定："},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暗之书的构筑体之一，力之构筑体。在“暗之书碎片”的事件中以菲特的形体为原型而具现化。因为是掌管力的构筑体因此拥有堂堂正正，单纯以力量来解决一切问题的直率性格，脾气秉性也如小孩一般爱憎分明，是那种无法被魔炮压服却会轻易被糖果收买的单纯的笨蛋。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20206"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38a3d1a1ae7ea00eb57ea7c84aa5738ff7b947758e0f7308fc2f194ab6a9c454.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae193cf9f173eb0575eced6b6ffab7afc6d15a3d8a84d29b94b072867374ded8.webp","width":194,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水樹奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s1236","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1236","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1236","name":"水樹奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:20206:1:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20241","characterName":"修缇露·萨·迪斯特拉库达","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20241","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"20241","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"修缇露·萨·迪斯特拉库达","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏设定："},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夜天之书中掌管理的构筑体，在“暗之书的碎片”事件中借用高町奈叶的外形而具现化。因为是理的构筑体，因此具有缜密的思维和冷静克制的性格，无论何时举手投足都如同处变不惊的千金小姐一般落落大方，只是在面对暗统之王时会因为对于对方的爱戴而进行一些近似于毒舌的吐槽。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20241"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/280b18a0df2688759ecbfb4d02bd54fdde29dfdf64d9b1ffe70d2b7c648180d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b891d3cd971461366c0afb374bfab2e5511ec3c22f296b4a45a7a7cbd2e6f20.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田村ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s104","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s104","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s104","name":"田村 ゆかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:20241:3965:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20242","characterName":"罗德·迪亚琪","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20242","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"20242","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"罗德·迪亚琪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏设定："},{"spoiler":false,"text":"暗之书的王之构筑体，持有着紫天之书的暗统之王，在暗之书化为碎片之时，借用夜天之主的外形得以具现化。企图通过摧毁一切来彰显自己的霸道，举手投足之间也尽量显示出王者的孤高和傲慢，但隐藏在这些表象背后紫天之主那与夜天之主无异的温柔王道，才是她得以维系与同伴和对手之间羁绊的真正纽带。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20242"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44aa9684c5d314071a6ace495f1b9d3a6e2573c29d8546ae476a26962b558992.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/eef3d32090c69a822593daaba1ff134f3076a523a34497969d989bbe6847dae6.webp","width":204,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"植田佳奈","creatorId":"vndb:s17","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s17","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s17","name":"植田 佳奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:20242:4263:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_2782","characterName":"管理局の白い悪魔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"2782","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"130569"},{"characterId":"2782","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"2782","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"53200"},{"characterId":"2782","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"管理局の白い悪魔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"24"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"无印（TV第一期）与A's（TV第二期）中的奈叶"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场年龄为9岁。居住于海鸣市，就读私立圣祥大学附属小学三年级；左撇子，擅长数理，不擅体育。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是一位开朗、温柔且善良的女孩，富有正义感，无法对他人的寂寞和悲伤视而不见，习惯隐藏心事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由于幼时与亚理沙以及铃香结为朋友的经过，使她有着行动前倾听对方想法的前提。不论是无印中的菲特·泰斯塔罗沙、A's中的守护骑士，奈叶的耐心与言语都让她们产生了改变。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"StrikerS（TV第三期）中的奈叶"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"登场年龄为19岁，任职于时空管理局武装队，担当职位为航空战技教导官，阶级为一等空尉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与菲特·泰斯塔罗沙、八神疾风一同被认为是管理局的王牌（ACE），在武装队内部更有着“超级王牌”的称号。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由于她的专业与尽职，赢得了上司与下属一致的信赖与好评；虽然在战技训练上相当严格，但却也是位体恤下属的长官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"转任至机动六课的战技教导官，兼任“Stars”分队的队长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她的性格依旧开朗与温柔，但是多了一份经历沧桑后的坚强。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"INNOCENT（漫画版）中的奈叶"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"更改为无印最初的普通小学生，就读海圣小学四年级。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与亚丽沙·巴宁斯、月村铃香一同踏入“Brave Duel”的游戏世界，在游戏中的等级为N，属性为“神圣”，服装则是稀有的“白”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"游戏《三角心3～永恒恋曲～》的奈叶"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"附赠短篇『花咲くころに会いましょう』及续篇《三角心3～莉莉卡露玩具箱～》的主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"士郎与桃子的女儿，恭也的异母妹，美由希的表妹。海鸣市私立圣祥大学附属小学的二年级生（OVA升上六年级）。咖啡厅“翠屋”的第二代预定接班人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然有些不擅长运动，但头脑很好，成绩优秀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着重视家人的温柔性格，虽然年纪还很小但总是为家人着想。和晶与莲是好友，两人在奈叶面前有些抬不起头。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为哥哥也有爱欺负人的一面所以有些对立，但基本上也很喜欢哥哥。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"2782"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学校","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"2782","value":"私立聖祥大附属小学校"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8b992403dbe4805b4d9a0b3ff80172b7b1e16b510bd86b144360bd1bf899a435.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/4812514776926fa0f85b0f0b3e180edd68bc514aa46b35c3fa22971b47714a5a.webp","width":181,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田村ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s104","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s104","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s104","name":"田村 ゆかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:2782:3965:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_2792","characterName":"菲特·泰斯特罗莎·哈拉温","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"2792","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"2792","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"菲特·泰斯特罗莎·哈拉温","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"无印（TV第一期）与A's（TV第二期）中的菲特"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外表年龄为9岁，右撇子 ，性格冷静，沉默寡言，予人难以亲近之感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但其实她是一名心地善良的女孩，因其“母亲”未曾给予她一般人都能得到的母爱，令她感到相当孤寂；她的内心深处相当渴望得到母亲的关爱，也因此接受母亲的要求，进行严酷的魔力和战斗训练，以及收集宝石种子的违法行动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"后来菲特得知自己的出生缘由，她勇敢地面对；虽然最后仍失去了敬爱的母亲，不过因为高町奈叶的扶持，让她变得坚强、变得更有勇气与意志力去守护她想守护的东西。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法和战斗知识为硕士水平。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因米德式魔法是经由数学计算建构的缘故，且与奈叶所处的世界并无差别，所以在校理科成绩优秀，甚至能解出美由希的高中数学题目，体育能力也有一定水平，但因为没有学过汉字的缘故，所以文科成绩极为可怜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名称取自于法拉利生产的旗舰型号Testarossa。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"StrikerS中的菲特"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正式成为琳蒂·哈洛温的养女，姓氏变更为菲特·T·哈洛温（フェイト・T・ハラオウン）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"登场年龄为19岁，任职于时空管理局，担当职位为执务官，阶级为一等尉，与高町奈叶、八神疾风一同被认为是管理局的王牌（ACE），在管理局内部有着“冰山美人”的称号。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"转任至机动六课后担任的职位为搜查指挥，兼任“Lightning”分队的队长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"任务途中，她保护了与她相同境遇的孩子们，并适时地给了他们一份温暖。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"2792"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"学校","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"2792","value":"私立聖祥大附属小学校"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d818e9833b157267dede635fa9f4195fadc18e743d7cf4e391bc363c0667557.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b170cf3c573c4616f55edd1b4012c5983304f797ae83344ad8503b19e6763a1f.webp","width":180,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水樹奈々","creatorId":"vndb:s1236","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1236","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1236","name":"水樹奈々","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:2792:1:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_2810","characterName":"薇塔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"2810","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"2810","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"薇塔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"120"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守護騎士ヴォルケンリッターの一員で、『鉄槌の騎士』。 闇の書の意志による二つ名は『紅の鉄騎』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"シャマル曰く「アタッカー」(A's SS01)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハンマー型アームドデバイス『グラーフアイゼン(Graf Eisen)』を操る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女は自由奔放・勝手気ままを旨とする。反抗的な態度をとることも多いが根は優しい子。(A's公式)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴォルケンリッターでは一番年下のちびっこ。 口も悪いが手も早く、直情的で負けず嫌い。 反抗期のようにシグナムには何かと突っかかる一方、認めたときには素直に謝罪や礼を言う一面もある。 はやてには完全に懐いており、夜は一緒のベッドで寝るほどの間柄である。 はやてからすれば小学１年生程度(A'sSS01)の妹のような存在で、ヴォルケンのメンバーの中でも特に可愛がっていたようである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ベルカの騎士としては例外的に近距離遠距離どちらでもいけるバランス型。 また、防御に徹した場合の対魔力・対物理の防御力はシグナムを凌ぐ。 だが、後方で砲台にならずに本人がやたら前に出たがる傾向があり、手数で勝負するシグナムとは対照的に、一撃必倒の突進技の多用が目立つ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"2810"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/5677a09541be2b94aac0ac04ee0fac2043f44d3f6b7070348cf9de60d57fa884.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccfb16f97850e6813d4bfe319675e3866ddac84c38ce7402a73ca9e464f5c5b0.webp","width":146,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真田アサミ","creatorId":"vndb:s1712","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1712","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1712","name":"真田 アサミ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:2810:3847:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_2812","characterName":"夏玛尔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"2812","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"2812","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"夏玛尔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守護騎士ヴォルケンリッターの一員で、参謀の『湖の騎士』。闇の書の意志による二つ名は『風の癒し手』。 金髪のショートボブの似合う、ほんわかタイプの美人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は生真面目ながら優しくほんのりとしていて、うっかり屋さんな部分もある。 そのため少し気弱で押しが弱い(A's公式)。 その性格もあって、参謀という肩書きがある割には、背後で権謀術策を巡らすようなタイプではない"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"2812"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e19879033615951c245e52affbebd73b3afca0ad60c496bc62844328d56a906.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/84/8419acfad5adf052741e8c3940728f26c37c6b2a2faccb93828cce34c597ebf2.webp","width":163,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚木涼香","creatorId":"vndb:s495","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s495","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s495","name":"柚木 涼香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:2812:4007:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_3740","characterName":"ユーノ・スクライア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"3740","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"3740","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ユーノ・スクライア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/56/569d7c8a8a30d499bc7289df564496c97ebea18cc3f32e4c2694f79b96c80f1b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf9f14020e5119478748dc0de2c11d016d8f61cad4944efe45233c85f71cb785.webp","width":146,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水橋かおり","creatorId":"vndb:s131","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s131","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s131","name":"水橋 かおり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:3740:3851:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_3743","characterName":"Chrono Harlaown","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"3743","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"130569"},{"characterId":"3743","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"29048"},{"characterId":"3743","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Chrono Harlaown","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"第一作与A's中的克罗诺"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"登场年龄为14岁，任职于时空管理局，担任执务官一职。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他是个给人沉默印象的人，但内心却是个热心而且正直的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在工作上，如果遭遇到不是出自于本意、或是因为情理因素而做错事情的人，身为执法者的他，会给予最大程度的帮助。无印时对奈叶有好感。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与艾蜜在士官学校是同学，两个人有姐弟般的感情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"StrikerS中的克罗诺"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"登场年龄为24岁，已婚，任职于时空管理局，担任次元航行部队的提督一职。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然身为提督的他已退出第一线作战任务，却仍然保有以往的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《莉莉卡露玩具箱》克洛诺・哈维（クロノ・ハーヴェイ）声：榊上総"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与奈叶敌对的少年魔法师。好像企图利用IdeaSeed引起次元灾害，但是……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"3743"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee7d556364adc9eebf6ebd8c1bbfdc0d3fa4648278c13d5bc6e27e7f642aea7a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21be4368522d58bb7ee3396545c76a19ab0580b747c8967cac4f0899279389c5.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高橋美佳子","creatorId":"vndb:s1866","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1866","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1866","name":"高橋美佳子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:8374:3743:4412:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_3753","characterName":"Lindy Harlaown","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"3753","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"130569"},{"characterId":"3753","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"8374"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Lindy Harlaown","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"任职于时空管理局，担任提督一职。同时也是Ｌ级巡航舰“阿斯拉”的舰长、克罗诺的母亲。在克罗诺一岁时因闇之书事件丈夫殉职，即使如此她还是持续专注在自己的职务上，是一位相当负责的长官。虽然她在管理局中的官阶相当高，但是待人非常和善亲切，完全不摆架子。喜欢甜食的她，有在绿茶里放入糖和牛奶的怪习惯。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在A's中，她对孤身一人的菲特十分关心，后更提议让菲特成为自己的养女，两人发展出如亲生母女般的关系。魔法阵的颜色是蓝绿色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"克莱德殉职后，将当初克莱德向自己告白的秋樱园仍照顾得很好。并于十年后表示自己对克莱德的爱至死不渝"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"于StrikerS漫画版当中，辞掉“阿斯拉”舰长的职务（但仍保有提督位阶）的琳蒂，出任总局事务统辖官之职。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《莉莉卡露玩具箱》声：姫乃彩"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从异世界・米德切尔达来到人界的女孩子。在人界只能以身高30厘米左右的妖精的身体行动。恳求奈叶回收IdeaSeed，并将能自由使用魔法的手杖「旭日之心」托付给答应了请求的奈叶。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"3753"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCand